                                Your trusted online pharmacy — delivering authentic medicines, wellness supplements,
                                and healthcare essentials with care since 2022.
                            </p>
                            <div class="hc-social-links mt-4">
                                <a href="https://www.youtube.com" target="_blank" class="hc-social-btn" aria-label="YouTube">
